      "text": [
        " مَشِيئَةِ اَللَّهِ قَالَ \"نَعَمْ ذَاكَ إِلَيْهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ إِنْ شَاءَ عَذَّبَ عَلَيْهَا وَ إِنْ شَاءَ عَفَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4966 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about the saying of Allah (swt), the Mighty and Majestic:\n\"Indeed, Allah (swt) does not forgive associating partners with Him, but He forgives what is less than that for whom He wills.\" (Surah An-Nisa 4:48)\nImam (as) was asked whether major sins are included in Allah's (swt) will (to forgive).\nImam (as) replied: \"Yes, that is up to Him (swt), the Mighty and Majestic. If He (swt) wills, He (swt) will punish for them, and if He (swt) wills, He (swt) will forgive.\""
        ]
      }
    },
